WEBVTT

00:12:57.996 --> 00:13:01.496
and recognize that language
will continue to change.

00:13:01.954 --> 00:13:04.704
And we can creatively use language

00:13:04.746 --> 00:13:09.246
to build the identities
and relationships that bring us joy.

00:13:09.287 --> 00:13:11.162
And that's not just allowable.

00:13:11.162 --> 00:13:12.412
It's right.

00:13:12.412 --> 00:13:13.621
Believe me.